29. Support Golden Rules

Put these prominently at the beginning of the runbook:

Never manually mark a payment as completed without reconciliation.

Never replay a financial request without checking idempotency.

Never delete an Outbox event to clear a backlog.

Never manually modify account/reservation balances without an approved transaction/recovery mechanism.

Always reconcile after recovery or replay.

Always preserve the original ACH file and generated response file.

