The most important addition for your application is a “Payment Investigation Guide.” Give support a single File ID, Batch ID, Payment/Trace ID, Reservation ID, or Settlement ID and show exactly how they trace the transaction across database → Outbox → Kafka → downstream reservation → response → response file → acknowledgement → settlement. That will dramatically reduce L2/L3 troubleshooting time.
